.TH "FWD UNINSTALL" "1" "2026-08-12" "fwdit" "fwd uninstall Manual"
.SH NAME
fwd\-uninstall \- Remove local fwd data, coding-agent skills,
completions, and temporary logs.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B fwd uninstall
[OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Remove local fwd data, coding-agent skills, completions, and temporary logs.
.PP
Refuses to discard state for tracked remote resources unless --force
explicitly accepts orphaning them. The
running CLI cannot remove its own environment portably, so the final
package-manager command is printed for you.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-force\fP
Skip confirmation; if sessions remain tracked, forget them without
stopping or destroying their remote resources.
.SH EXIT STATUS
\fB0\fP indicates success. Any nonzero value indicates an error.
.SH REPORTING BUGS
Report issues at \fIhttps://github.com/Sid-MB/fwd/issues\fP.
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBfwd\fP(1)
